<title>FRANCE: Schiphol leads June cargo growth, London tops Jan-June.</title>
<headline>Schiphol leads June cargo growth, London tops Jan-June.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amsterdam's Schiphol airport recorded the highest percentage gain in traffic amongst the EU's top cargo airports in June 1997 compared to the same month the previous year, according to figures issued by the Paris airports authority (ADP).</p>
<p>London airports recorded the highest January-June 1997 growth, the ADP figures also showed.</p>
<p>Airport		    June 1997	     Pct change on</p>
<p>			     (in tonnes)	   June 1996</p>
<p>London*		     133,936		up  8.6</p>
<p>Frankfurt		   112,091		up  1.9</p>
<p>Paris**			95,433		up  1.1</p>
<p>Amsterdam		    93,298		up  9.6</p>
<p>			     Jan-June 1997	 Pct change on</p>
<p>			     (in tonnes)	   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>London*		     753,244		 up  7.8</p>
<p>Frankfurt		   659,872		 up  2.8</p>
<p>Amsterdam		   566,461		 up  6.9</p>
<p>Paris**		     552,149		 up  2.5</p>
<p>*  includes Heathrow, Gatwick and Stansted</p>
<p>** includes Charles de Gaulle and Orly</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
